      <VERS vnumber="4"> Let <gr str="3605">all </gr>those that <gr str="1245">seek </gr>thee <gr str="7797">rejoice </gr>and be <gr str="8055">glad </gr>in thee: and let such as <gr str="157">love </gr>thy <gr str="3444">salvation </gr>
        <gr str="559">say </gr>
        <gr str="8548">continually</gr>, Let <gr str="430">God </gr>be <gr str="1431">magnified</gr>. </VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="5"> But <gr str="589">I </gr>
        <STYLE css="color:#808080;font-style:italic"> am </STYLE>
        <gr str="6041">poor </gr>and <gr str="34">needy</gr>: make <gr str="2363">haste </gr>unto me, O <gr str="430">God</gr>: <gr str="859">thou </gr>
        <STYLE css="color:#808080;font-style:italic"> art </STYLE> my <gr str="5828">help </gr>and my <gr str="6403">deliverer</gr>; O <gr str="3068">LORD</gr>, make <gr str="408">no </gr>
